// The shared bridge model, baked into assets/buildings/bridges.pak by tools/gc_artbake
// (`cargo run -p gc_artbake --release -- --config assets-src/buildings/bridges.ron --out assets/buildings/bridges.pak`).
// One 1 x 1 tile of a bridge running along the model's z (the game turns it to its line), with the
// deck's top 0.28 tiles above the water (buildings.rs DECK_TOP). Every faction's bridge shows it until
// it has a model of its own (a model named after the bridge, e.g. "Bone Causeway", takes over).
// Four looks as for buildings: `#1` foundation, `#2` frame, `#3` half planked, then the finished tile.
// Source: the project's design/buildings/source/buildings/ember/timber_bridge.py.
(
    models: [
        (
            name: "Timber Bridge #1",
            source: "shared:grubcraft/buildings-detail/shared/timber-bridge/stage1.glb",
            height: 0.95,
